pve-ups-panel (1.0.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * UPS monitoring panel for Proxmox VE node pages.
  * Backend: PVE::API2::UPS — GET /nodes/{node}/ups via upsc.
  * Frontend: ExtJS panel with dashboard gauges and detail cards.
  * Settings wizard: standalone / netclient / netserver modes.
  * USB UPS auto-detection via lsusb (CyberPower, APC).

